WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.940
Respiration is how living organisms convert food into usable energy.

00:04.940 --> 00:09.208
Our bodies use glucose from food and oxygen we breathe.

00:09.210 --> 00:14.030
This vital process primarily happens within our cells' mitochondria.

00:14.030 --> 00:20.320
It releases energy (ATP), carbon dioxide, and water as byproducts.

00:20.320 --> 00:24.640
Respiration fuels every function, from thinking to moving!
